    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "t7JCd",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 24030,
      "name": "Focus · 画板外业务口径",
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 600,
      "fill": "$surface",
      "cornerRadius": 16,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 12,
      "padding": 32,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "q7J1q",
          "name": "标题",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "content": "专注计时 · 画板外业务口径",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 24,
          "fontWeight": "semibold"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "wthMZ",
          "name": "副标题",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "用户可见状态只有未开始 / 计时中 / 已暂停；倒计时归零、结束确认分别属于显示变体与结束流程的一步。",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "gB3tZ",
          "name": "规则",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "01  用户可见的计时状态只有三个：未开始、计时中、已暂停。倒计时归零与结束确认分别是「计时中」的显示变体和结束流程的一步，界面上不再出现额外状态标签。",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "X7Igap",
          "name": "规则",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "02  暂停不计入投入时长。会话保存开始时刻、倒计时终点锚点与暂停区间，界面显示的剩余与已用时长由这些字段与当前时刻推导，不依赖逐秒累加。",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Y0BtK",
          "name": "规则",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "03  倒计时归零后只提醒一次，计时继续走并转为警告色；不自动结束计时，也不自动标记任务完成。",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "sE3kT",
          "name": "规则",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "04  点「结束」后先弹出确认浮层，默认值已按规则填好，确认后才写入。这一层同时承担「结束」与「放弃」的分流。",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "e5QYzx",
          "name": "规则",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "05  「结束」写入一条行动记录；「放弃」不写记录，用于误触。两个动作在界面上用文字写明差异，不只靠图标或颜色区分。",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "k9QX2H",
          "name": "规则",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "06  记录投入与标记完成是两条独立写入，界面不提供「一步完成」的合并按钮。",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "c5Jsa",
          "name": "规则",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "07  到点提醒按有效剩余时间判断：暂停时撤销已排期的提醒，继续时按新的有效终点重新排期。",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "G8fxh",
          "name": "规则",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "08  暂停中、或倒计时归零后长时间无人操作，下次打开应用提示处理，不静默作废也不静默续上。",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "h146m",
          "name": "规则",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "09  独立待办（未挂计划）同样可以开始专注与记录投入。",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "r6MFF1",
          "name": "规则",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "10  锁屏与灵动岛 Live Activity、专注时长统计、跨设备同步专注会话不在本轮范围。",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "WVkJT",
          "name": "规则",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "11  「开始专注」的副文案显示推导出的时长，如「开始专注 · 30 分钟」；没有起止时间也没有预计投入时显示「开始专注 · 正计时」。",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "bl5jd",
          "name": "规则",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "12  计时页可下拉收起；收起后回到进入前的任务上下文，计时以 Focus / Bar 继续在其他页面可见。",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
